  "hypothesis": "Cached lexicographic prefixes and stable bottom-up index mergesort should remove quadratic insertion dependencies and reduce strcmp traffic. Separating branch-free pair ordering from string-tie resolution exposes legal SIMD work while keeping dependent merge cursors scalar.",
